cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Inspection Coordinates in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Inspection Coordinates: physics-grounded structural coordinates for semiconductor inspection images"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Parrish
    given-names: Russell
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0008-9781-7995
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-21
license: MIT
url: https://www.parallaxmetrology.com/semiconductor_pm.html
repository-code: https://github.com/parallaxmetrology/inspection-coordinates
keywords: [semiconductor inspection, metrology, SEM, wafer map, defect classification, interpretable features]
abstract: >
  Fifteen training-free structural coordinates for inspection images (SEM, wafer
  maps, aerial images): intensity placement and spread, edge log-slope and
  roughness, and spectral energy bands. Reproducible benchmarks on the Carinthia
  SEM and MixedWM38 wafer-map datasets.
